    "created_at": "2022-09-19T19:24:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-19T19:24:25Z",
    "body": "It depends if we want to encourage authors to modify after creation. I think implementation-wise, if we support addStop, adding colorspace mutation support should be easy, so I think this is an API design question.\r\n\r\nDo \"we\" have a philosophy here with regards to strongly discouraging mutation?",
