    "created_at": "2022-09-20T01:55:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-20T01:55:06Z",
    "body": "Regarding the mutability of `CanvasGradient` objects, I want to clarify that modifying it through `addColorStop()` is currently the only way to define a non transparent `CanvasGradient` object. I don't think mutability is a problem here.   \r\n\r\nFor the API design, there is also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8214 which will probably extend these methods, it would be great to coordinate the efforts on this.   \r\nPersonally I'd also vote for the option bag + properties idea (2 & 3), though adding properties may open the question \"*why not expose the color-stops?*\".  ",
